# Core Game Logic Package (`packages/core`)

This package contains the core game logic, types, and validation for Skyjo. It is used by both the API and web app.

## Key Files & Directories:
- **[`src/`](mdc:packages/core/src)**: Main source code for game logic and types.
  - **[`class/`](mdc:packages/core/src/class)**: Main game classes (e.g., `Game`, `Player`, `Settings`, `Card`, `KickVote`).
  - **[`types/`](mdc:packages/core/src/types)**: TypeScript types for game entities and state.
  - **[`validations/`](mdc:packages/core/src/validations)**: Zod schemas for validating game actions and state.
  - **[`constants.ts`](mdc:packages/core/src/constants.ts)**: Game constants and enums.
  - **[`index.ts`](mdc:packages/core/src/index.ts)**: Entry point for exports.
- **[`tests/`](mdc:packages/core/tests)**: Unit tests for core logic.
- **[`package.json`](mdc:packages/core/package.json)**: Dependencies and scripts.
- **[`tsconfig.json`](mdc:packages/core/tsconfig.json)**: TypeScript configuration.

## Notes
- All logic is pure TypeScript, no external dependencies except for validation.
- Designed for maximum reusability and testability.